{"page":286,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:39","surah":17,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ مِمَّآ أَوْحَىٰٓ إِلَيْكَ رَبُّكَ مِنَ ٱلْحِكْمَةِ ۗ وَلَا تَجْعَلْ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَـٰهًا ءَاخَرَ فَتُلْقَىٰ فِى جَهَنَّمَ مَلُومًا مَّدْحُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], this is some of the wisdom your Lord has revealed to you: do not set up another god beside God, or you will be thrown into Hell, blamed and rejected.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِمَّآ","en_gloss":"(is) from what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوْحَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"(was) revealed","transliteration":"awḥā","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"(from) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحِكْمَةِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the wisdom","transliteration":"l-ḥik'mati","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَجْعَلْ","en_gloss":"make","transliteration":"tajʿal","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَـٰهًا","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāhan","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَاخَرَ","en_gloss":"other","transliteration":"ākhara","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَتُلْقَىٰ","en_gloss":"lest you should be thrown","transliteration":"fatul'qā","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":16,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَلُومًۭا","en_gloss":"blameworthy","transliteration":"malūman","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَّدْحُورًا","en_gloss":"abandoned","transliteration":"madḥūran","verse_key":"17:39"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:39"}]},{"verse_key":"17:40","surah":17,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَأَصْفَىٰكُمْ رَبُّكُم بِٱلْبَنِينَ وَٱتَّخَذَ مِنَ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ إِنَـٰثًا ۚ إِنَّكُمْ لَتَقُولُونَ قَوْلًا عَظِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What? Has your Lord favoured you people with sons and taken daughters for Himself from the angels?What a monstrous thing for you to say!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَأَصْفَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"Then has your Lord chosen (for) you","transliteration":"afa-aṣfākum","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبُّكُم","en_gloss":"Then has your Lord chosen (for) you","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْبَنِينَ","en_gloss":"sons","transliteration":"bil-banīna","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱتَّخَذَ","en_gloss":"and He has taken","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadha","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikati","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَـٰثًا ۚ","en_gloss":"daughters","transliteration":"ināthan","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innakum","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَتَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"surely say","transliteration":"lataqūlūna","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَوْلًا","en_gloss":"a word","transliteration":"qawlan","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَظِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"grave","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","verse_key":"17:40"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:40"}]},{"verse_key":"17:41","surah":17,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ صَرَّفْنَا فِى هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانِ لِيَذَّكَّرُوا۟ وَمَا يَزِيدُهُمْ إِلَّا نُفُورًا","en_translation_i