)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:45"}]},{"verse_key":"17:46","surah":17,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ أَكِنَّةً أَن يَفْقَهُوهُ وَفِىٓ ءَاذَانِهِمْ وَقْرًا ۚ وَإِذَا ذَكَرْتَ رَبَّكَ فِى ٱلْقُرْءَانِ وَحْدَهُۥ وَلَّوْا۟ عَلَىٰٓ أَدْبَـٰرِهِمْ نُفُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have put covers on their hearts that prevent them from understanding it, and heaviness in their ears. When you mention your Lord in the Quran, and Him alone, they turn their backs and run away.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have placed","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَكِنَّةً","en_gloss":"coverings","transliteration":"akinnatan","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَفْقَهُوهُ","en_gloss":"they understand it","transliteration":"yafqahūhu","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَفِىٓ","en_gloss":"and in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَاذَانِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their ears","transliteration":"ādhānihim","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَقْرًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"deafness","transliteration":"waqran","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذَكَرْتَ","en_gloss":"you mention","transliteration":"dhakarta","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āni","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَحْدَهُۥ","en_gloss":"Alone","transliteration":"waḥdahu","verse_key":"17:46"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَل